1
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:46,719
So spicy.

2
00:01:46,719 --> 00:01:48,359
It's the chili's fault.

3
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:59,120
Next time we meet,

4
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:02,159
it'll be someone else.

5
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,840
What do you mean, replaced?

6
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,000
It's an assignment.

7
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,439
I got a short-notice assignment out of town.

8
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:29,840
It could be for a long time.

9
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,800
How long?

10
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,280
Until it's over,

11
00:02:41,879 --> 00:02:43,080
nobody gives that kind of detail.

12
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:48,479
When you first met Li Fengge,

13
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:50,240
she should have told you

14
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:52,199
that if someone needs to be replaced,

15
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,240
or if my assignment changes,

16
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,240
between the two of us,

17
00:02:58,599 --> 00:03:00,520
all contact must be cut off immediately.

18
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,479
I'll also take on a new identity,

19
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:06,120
get a new phone number,

20
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:07,520
a new name,

21
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,520
and start over.

22
00:03:13,759 --> 00:03:15,560
If you ever need anything in the future,

23
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,879
you can only reach out to your new friend.

24
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,759
If I ever need to reach you,

25
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,520
I can only go through that future friend of yours.

26
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,360
No matter how urgent it is,

27
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:34,479
we can never contact each other again.

28
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:45,719
As required,

29
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,240
I need to state this clearly,

30
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:52,039
and ask you to repeat it back.

31
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:33,279
Whatever you say.

32
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:37,319
If you say no contact, then no contact.

33
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,279
Here, ma'am.

34
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,720
I refunded one of the fish ball orders.

35
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:53,600
It's written at the bottom: refunded.

36
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,680
What about this? What's this charge?

37
00:04:55,879 --> 00:04:57,079
That's for the napkins.

38
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,079
I've been here many times.

39
00:04:59,079 --> 00:05:00,639
Napkins have never cost anything.

40
00:05:00,759 --> 00:05:01,480
When we first sat down,

41
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,680
why didn't the server say anything?

42
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,879
Why charge for them now?

43
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:06,319
It says on the box: one yuan.

44
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,040
We were in the middle of talking.

45
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,079
We're both very busy.

46
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:10,920
Who has time to look at the fine print?

47
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,240
Do I also have to check

48
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,600
every single pair of chopsticks?

49
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:14,839
All right, all right, I'll refund it.

50
00:05:14,839 --> 00:05:16,000
I don't need your refund.

51
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,319
I just want to get this straight.

52
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:19,040
It's the principle of the matter.

53
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:20,560
You're allowed to charge,

54
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,959
so why, when I just sat down,

55
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:22,879
didn't you say anything?

56
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,240
Why wait until I come to pay the bill

57
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,399
to tell me there's a charge?

58
00:05:25,399 --> 00:05:26,560
I already agreed to refund it, miss.

59
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,759
Right, I already told you.

60
00:05:27,759 --> 00:05:29,439
Stop pulling me.

61
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,839
Don't you think it's their fault?

62
00:05:32,079 --> 00:05:33,639
You know they're in the wrong,

63
00:05:33,839 --> 00:05:34,639
don't you?

64
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,480
Aren't they picking on us?

65
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,519
Why won't you say a word for me?

66
00:05:39,759 --> 00:05:41,480
You know it's their fault too,

67
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,560
right?

68
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:46,160
You don't think it's their fault?

69
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:49,879
I just...

70
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:52,439
I just wanted to enjoy a decent meal!

71
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:55,439
Stop touching me, okay?

72
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,720
Why?

73
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,399
All of you...

74
00:06:05,399 --> 00:06:06,040
You're all...

75
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,040
...picking on me!

76
00:06:09,399 --> 00:06:10,759
Wh-Why?

77
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,800
Why?

78
00:06:51,879 --> 00:06:52,720
It's all been decrypted.

79
00:06:52,759 --> 00:06:53,680
This "postman"...

80
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:55,360
is that postman named Fan from before.

81
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:58,160
This is about the naval dock incident.

82
00:06:58,519 --> 00:06:59,399
"Northward trip successful."

83
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,680
That refers to Cao Liaoping

84
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,800
going to Beijing back then.

85
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:03,600
And starting from that point,

86
00:07:03,759 --> 00:07:05,079
his courier was Lin Kanshan.

87
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:08,560
But after Operation Spring Thunder,

88
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,120
it seems his courier changed again.

89
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:12,319
Not sure if it means himself or Wen Zongshu.

90
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,959
Once we catch him,

91
00:07:15,279 --> 00:07:16,279
you can ask him in person.

92
00:07:26,839 --> 00:07:27,839
What's wrong?

93
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,759
I told her about the replacement.

94
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,240
Do you know why she keeps

95
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,720
dating constantly?

96
00:07:40,519 --> 00:07:42,279
Flitting from one guy to another.

97
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:45,560
She knows some of them are no good,

98
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,319
but she dates them anyway.

99
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,040
It's just like drinking.

100
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,519
She needs to numb herself.

101
00:07:57,639 --> 00:07:58,959
What else could she do?

102
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:05,040
No one is truly sincere with her.

103
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,959
Not even Lin Kanshan.

104
00:08:10,399 --> 00:08:12,040
First there was Jin Chizhong,

105
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,319
then Li Fengge,

106
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,439
and now me.

107
00:08:15,439 --> 00:08:16,600
We leave at a moment's notice.

108
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,319
She has no friend to confide in.

109
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:25,639
If it were me, I'd probably do the same,

110
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:27,480
taking it one day at a time.

111
00:08:28,439 --> 00:08:30,480
Why bother thinking about the future?

112
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:35,080
Everyone's like that.

113
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,240
We can only focus on living in the present.

114
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,759
At least we have the codebook now.

115
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:44,519
Combined with the decrypted data cards,

116
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:46,039
email accounts, and encryption,

117
00:08:46,159 --> 00:08:48,679
we can connect all covert communications.

118
00:08:52,639 --> 00:08:54,279
Yet we still can't make any arrests.

119
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,559
It's been over a decade,

120
00:08:57,399 --> 00:08:58,720
and we still have to wait.

121
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:05,879
We have no choice but to wait,

122
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,559
to see if using him can lure out Ma Qi.

123
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:11,080
They're all fish

124
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:12,879
trapped in the same pond.

125
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,879
Sooner or later, we'll hook them.

126
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:35,879
Doing things like this all the time

127
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:38,200
will really send you to hell.

128
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,000
Come with me.

129
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:01,879
I'll protect you for life.

130
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,840
Did you hear me?

131
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:07,080
Come with me.

132
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,080
I'll protect you.

133
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:10,960
Forever.

134
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:12,600
Get lost.

135
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:13,720
Get lost.

136
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:17,039
You're drunk.

137
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,840
Get away from me.

138
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:44,919
Everything's going smoothly.

139
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:47,440
I'm on my way to the meeting.

140
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:52,559
When did this happen?

141
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,679
Is she out of danger now?

142
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,000
All right.

143
00:11:56,759 --> 00:11:57,840
The place is pretty nice.

144
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:28,919
What could be troubling you so much?

145
00:12:29,759 --> 00:12:31,559
Is this a trend nowadays?

146
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:33,600
You just had to join in too?

147
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:37,320
Just an old ailment. I'm fine.

148
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,279
"Fine"?

149
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,000
When something happens, it's terrifying.

150
00:12:47,039 --> 00:12:47,960
In the end,

151
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,159
I'm always the one cleaning up the mess.

152
00:12:52,639 --> 00:12:53,559
Eat something.

153
00:12:54,759 --> 00:12:55,799
You look terrible.

154
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,120
Excuse me, sir.

155
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,080
The patient needs to rest.

156
00:13:21,759 --> 00:13:23,279
Listen to the doctor.

157
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,840
I'll come visit you again in a while.

158
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:33,840
Nurse.

159
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:36,320
Sorry to trouble you. Thank you.

160
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:37,440
You're welcome.

161
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:49,120
Let's take your temperature.

162
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:39,480
A-Bao.

163
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:40,879
A-Bao.

164
00:15:41,679 --> 00:15:42,320
A-Bao.

165
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:43,519
Brought you food.

166
00:15:44,679 --> 00:15:45,879
Ma Qi isn't home yet.

167
00:15:46,279 --> 00:15:47,399
How has the target been lately?

168
00:15:47,679 --> 00:15:49,840
Any pattern to his daily routine?

169
00:15:50,679 --> 00:15:52,080
He's been very cautious lately.

170
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,600
Noticeably fewer phone calls.

171
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:54,799
Especially with Yang Shiwen.

172
00:15:54,799 --> 00:15:56,360
The two of them barely spoke on the phone.

173
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:58,000
Yang Shiwen's contact with Taipei

174
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,240
has been paused for a while too.

175
00:15:59,879 --> 00:16:01,120
Only phone calls were cut off.

176
00:16:01,279 --> 00:16:02,559
Contact won't just stop.

177
00:16:03,639 --> 00:16:05,240
Maybe they're being cautious

178
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,799
and switched to another method.

179
00:16:06,919 --> 00:16:08,720
Intel peddlers are still dealers.

180
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,639
Business means covert communications.

181
00:16:10,799 --> 00:16:11,519
By the way,

182
00:16:12,039 --> 00:16:14,039
any foreign friends contact him lately?

183
00:16:14,039 --> 00:16:14,840
What about Qiao Liang?

184
00:16:15,759 --> 00:16:17,759
He only called Ma Qi once.

185
00:16:17,759 --> 00:16:18,720
He used code.

186
00:16:19,399 --> 00:16:21,559
Told him to go to the café by the gate

187
00:16:21,559 --> 00:16:23,399
on Saturday, order two drinks at window 37,

188
00:16:23,399 --> 00:16:25,519
and take the fourth chair in the third row.

189
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:28,000
Actually, there's no café at the gate.

190
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,679
If you extract the numbers,

191
00:16:29,679 --> 00:16:30,799
it makes a phone number.

192
00:16:34,279 --> 00:16:35,679
Sharp nose as always.

193
00:16:36,559 --> 00:16:38,639
Wonder if he's onto something.

194
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:41,200
Ma Qi is back.

195
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,279
In local news,

196
00:17:01,279 --> 00:17:02,799
on the fifth anniversary

197
00:17:02,799 --> 00:17:04,680
of direct cross-strait Three Links,

198
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,759
Fujian-Taiwan, China trips passed 10 million.

199
00:17:07,759 --> 00:17:09,359
Can you hear what he's saying?

200
00:17:10,039 --> 00:17:11,039
with 20,000 passengers transported...

201
00:17:11,039 --> 00:17:11,920
The TV is too loud.

202
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:13,160
I can't hear a single thing.

203
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:16,359
Someone is watching you.

204
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:17,599
What do you plan to do?

205
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:21,119
Let's see if he has the skill to catch me.

206
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:23,240
If I were Ma Qi,

207
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:25,680
I'd use World War II covert communications.

208
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:26,880
If he strictly follows

209
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,680
a meticulous plan

210
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:29,759
to meet with his contact,

211
00:17:29,759 --> 00:17:31,599
the risk will be kept to a minimum.

212
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:33,839
He understands risk better than anyone.

213
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:36,839
Lao Wei once said,

214
00:17:36,839 --> 00:17:37,640
in some past cases,

215
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,119
why did the other side never slip up?

216
00:17:39,119 --> 00:17:39,960
Because both parties

217
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,839
strictly followed their agreed protocol.

218
00:17:41,839 --> 00:17:43,319
If they stay that cautious,

219
00:17:43,319 --> 00:17:45,039
will we never find any leverage on them?

220
00:17:45,039 --> 00:17:46,160
It's a matter of probability.

221
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,240
Between the two sides,

222
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:49,200
it's about who slips up first.

223
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,799
If he makes a mistake first,

224
00:17:50,799 --> 00:17:52,519
but I fail to capitalize on it,

225
00:17:52,519 --> 00:17:54,000
that might be his only slip-up.

226
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,319
Once it passes, it's gone.

227
00:17:55,319 --> 00:17:56,880
And he'll never make it again.

228
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:58,039
Or for example,

229
00:17:58,039 --> 00:17:59,720
someone breaches protocol just once,

230
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,079
and you happen to catch it,

231
00:18:01,079 --> 00:18:02,599
then the case might be solved.

232
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:05,079
In our field, it's all about probability.

233
00:18:05,519 --> 00:18:07,160
What do we do next, then?

234
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,880
They're using old methods,

235
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,559
so we can't rely on new tech.

236
00:18:10,559 --> 00:18:11,440
Starting tomorrow,

237
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:12,359
the moment he steps outside,

238
00:18:12,359 --> 00:18:13,480
have people tail him.

239
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:14,920
When he meets with the contact,

240
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,920
the key is that golden ten minutes.

241
00:18:17,039 --> 00:18:18,160
If we miss it,

242
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,319
it's gone for good.

243
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,559
But he's only human.

244
00:18:20,559 --> 00:18:22,559
He gets tired, and he makes mistakes.

245
00:18:23,079 --> 00:18:23,799
Just wait and see.

246
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:42,079
Is it just in my head, or what?

247
00:18:42,079 --> 00:18:43,799
Why do I look like a rabbit now?

248
00:18:45,079 --> 00:18:47,480
Better than looking like a donkey.

249
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:50,279
What more can you expect around here?

250
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,839
When are you leaving?

251
00:18:55,559 --> 00:18:56,720
Waiting for a ticket.

252
00:18:56,880 --> 00:18:57,839
More people have arrived recently.

253
00:18:57,839 --> 00:18:58,839
Airfare has gone up too.

254
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,240
You're crying poor too?

255
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:03,599
Then I might as well beg on the street.

256
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:07,240
You don't visit Melior Special Economic Zone for nothing.

257
00:19:07,839 --> 00:19:09,720
Did you get some inside information?

258
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:12,279
Staking your whole life and fortune here.

259
00:19:12,799 --> 00:19:14,759
Give me a little something at least.

260
00:19:14,759 --> 00:19:17,559
Just enough for me to report back with.

261
00:19:17,799 --> 00:19:19,079
You're certainly not picky.

262
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,480
What do you want?

263
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:22,680
Huanyu 10 is launching soon.

264
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:24,759
The whole world is watching.

265
00:19:24,759 --> 00:19:27,559
Jiuquan Satellite Launch Center.

266
00:19:27,559 --> 00:19:29,799
Manual rendezvous and docking,

267
00:19:29,799 --> 00:19:31,200
rigid coupling,

268
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,960
propellants...

269
00:19:32,960 --> 00:19:36,119
Boosters, launch, orbital...

270
00:19:36,119 --> 00:19:37,079
I'm not picky.

271
00:19:37,079 --> 00:19:38,519
I'll take whatever I can get.

272
00:19:38,519 --> 00:19:40,039
How much do you have on hand?

273
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,039
I'm just a broker.

274
00:19:42,519 --> 00:19:44,519
I must ask both buyers and sellers.

275
00:19:44,519 --> 00:19:45,720
You made the scope so wide,

276
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:46,799
who am I supposed to ask?

277
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:49,200
My only worry is that you can't find it.

278
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:50,599
The more contacts you have, the better.

279
00:19:51,119 --> 00:19:54,240
Anything on Huanyu is in high demand.

280
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:56,599
Just like these cigars.

281
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:59,160
Even the ashes have buyers.

282
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:01,119
You've been shuttling back and forth,

283
00:20:01,119 --> 00:20:03,920
how much foreign intel do you pull yearly?

284
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:06,079
I don't pay any less than Taiwan, China.

285
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:08,640
Cut a brother some slack.

286
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:14,160
The MIB had a female lieutenant

287
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,359
who fled to the UK last year.

288
00:20:15,359 --> 00:20:16,799
She refuses to return to Taiwan, China,

289
00:20:16,799 --> 00:20:18,240
which left Taipei thoroughly embarrassed.

290
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:19,160
Have you heard about that?

291
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:20,839
I have relatives in London.

292
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,400
What are you getting at?

293
00:20:24,599 --> 00:20:25,640
Catch a fish from the river,

294
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,960
pick some tea from the tree.

295
00:20:27,359 --> 00:20:28,000
Give yours to him,

296
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:28,839
and give his to you.

297
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:31,359
I'm just a middleman.

298
00:20:31,559 --> 00:20:32,759
What else do you think I want?

299
00:20:33,599 --> 00:20:34,240
Understood.

300
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:42,119
Our progress right now is still too slow.

301
00:20:42,119 --> 00:20:44,160
We're still short of mission requirements.

302
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:46,960
Based on our current findings,

303
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:52,039
based on our current findings,

304
00:20:52,039 --> 00:20:53,799
if booster technology

305
00:20:53,799 --> 00:20:55,319
remains stuck at its current level,

306
00:20:55,799 --> 00:20:57,599
it will not only hold us back,

307
00:20:57,839 --> 00:21:00,519
but the entire manned space program.

308
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:03,319
That is a responsibility we cannot bear.

309
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:18,920
Gentlemen,

310
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:21,519
this piece of land is truly great.

311
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,839
It looks a bit barren right now,

312
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:26,920
but policy tailwinds are already blowing.

313
00:21:28,519 --> 00:21:29,400
You didn't even say what this was about,

314
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:31,279
just called and had me rush over.

315
00:21:31,279 --> 00:21:33,640
What could we do in the middle of nowhere?

316
00:21:35,279 --> 00:21:36,480
This pie is too big

317
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:38,000
for one person to swallow alone.

318
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:40,880
As Taiwan, China Chamber's Deputy Secretary-General,

319
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,160
I can't let my position go to waste.

320
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:44,119
Bringing some friends together

321
00:21:44,119 --> 00:21:45,480
for a joint acquisition,

322
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,799
we can do this together.

323
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:50,599
Build a hot spring resort hotel,

324
00:21:50,599 --> 00:21:52,519
everyone contributing what they can.

325
00:21:52,759 --> 00:21:54,440
So, are you interested?

326
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:55,559
What do you mean?

327
00:21:56,759 --> 00:21:59,240
Back then, Xie Fengshi made grand promises,

328
00:21:59,359 --> 00:22:00,720
claiming he'd turn this place into

329
00:22:00,799 --> 00:22:02,319
Asia's largest industrial park.

330
00:22:03,039 --> 00:22:05,400
Yet the investors fell through.

331
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:07,240
Funding dried up right after launch,

332
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:08,200
and it was quickly abandoned.

333
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:10,079
Look at this plot.

334
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:12,119
Now the villagers

335
00:22:12,119 --> 00:22:13,759
have cut through the wire fence

336
00:22:13,759 --> 00:22:15,400
to graze their sheep.

337
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:16,720
Leaving it idle is such a waste!

338
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:18,720
Still, there's an airport nearby,

339
00:22:18,720 --> 00:22:20,279
and it's for dual military-civilian use.

340
00:22:20,279 --> 00:22:21,720
With all that noise,

341
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:24,119
how could a resort hotel work?

342
00:22:24,799 --> 00:22:26,039
For a project of this scale,

343
00:22:26,039 --> 00:22:27,039
can we even pull it off?

344
00:22:27,039 --> 00:22:29,960
District Chief Wu has reminded us:

345
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,720
don't just look at the economic balance,

346
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:32,960
look at the political dividends.

347
00:22:33,119 --> 00:22:34,960
Haven't you been watching the news lately?

348
00:22:35,839 --> 00:22:36,920
The trade fair is expanding,

349
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:39,079
and an entrepreneurs summit is coming up.

350
00:22:39,079 --> 00:22:40,119
Perhaps very soon,

351
00:22:40,440 --> 00:22:42,880
both sides will sign many economic pacts.

352
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:44,160
What does that tell you?

353
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:46,119
Stay ahead of the game.

354
00:22:46,720 --> 00:22:49,720
Being Taiwan, China Chamber's Deputy Secretary-General

355
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:51,200
has its ups and downs.

356
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:52,440
I'm exhausted to death every day,

357
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,680
having to oversee everything.

358
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:56,200
Then again, you get all the inside scoops.

359
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:58,160
With my ear to the ground,

360
00:22:58,160 --> 00:22:59,759
I find out about everything in advance.

361
00:22:59,759 --> 00:23:00,920
So take my advice, brother.

362
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:03,039
Tourism development is a must.

363
00:23:03,799 --> 00:23:04,960
Secretary-General Lin.

364
00:23:05,519 --> 00:23:06,240
District Chief Wu.

365
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,319
How does it look to you?

366
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:10,200
Have you noticed something?

367
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:12,000
No chickens, ducks, or geese around.

368
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:13,000
He comes here all the time.

369
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:15,359
He's eaten all his fellow poultry here.

370
00:23:18,279 --> 00:23:19,880
What are your plans for lunch?

371
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:21,720
The delegation is heading to Zhangzhou,

372
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:22,759
so we don't have to look after them.

373
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:25,039
What about you? What are your plans?

374
00:23:25,039 --> 00:23:26,640
I'll leave that up to you, of course.

375
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:30,799
Don't mind how dirty the bottle looks.

376
00:23:30,799 --> 00:23:32,160
Once a bottle is gone, it's gone.

377
00:23:32,160 --> 00:23:35,279
Bargaining at a demolition two years ago,

378
00:23:35,279 --> 00:23:36,759
I saw there were only three bottles left,

379
00:23:36,759 --> 00:23:37,759
so I bought them all.

380
00:23:40,559 --> 00:23:42,200
If you hadn't brought this,

381
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,599
I wouldn't know if it was real or fake.

382
00:23:43,799 --> 00:23:44,880
Drink up without worry.

383
00:23:45,559 --> 00:23:47,480
Look at the beads in this liquor.

384
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:49,400
Rolling like rushing waves, aren't they?

385
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:51,559
There's even writing on it.

386
00:23:51,680 --> 00:23:53,039
1972.

387
00:23:53,039 --> 00:23:54,359
I was still in diapers back then.

388
00:23:54,359 --> 00:23:56,079
There are real gems among the common folk.

389
00:23:56,119 --> 00:23:58,039
Here, brother, let me toast you first.

390
00:23:58,400 --> 00:23:59,519
My heartfelt thanks to you.

391
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,440
Thanks for what?

392
00:24:02,799 --> 00:24:03,799
What's the occasion?

393
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:05,440
It's about my little secretary.

394
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:06,799
You arranged for her

395
00:24:06,799 --> 00:24:08,720
an official post at the Art Federation,

396
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:10,200
so she can get a pension down the road.

397
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:12,799
Where do you find a boss and secretary like this?

398
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,799
Just dating without ever getting married.

399
00:24:14,799 --> 00:24:16,359
What are you actually trying to do?

400
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:18,440
Too many romances.

401
00:24:18,440 --> 00:24:19,359
I can't keep up with them all.

402
00:24:19,359 --> 00:24:20,319
But as for my secretary,

403
00:24:20,319 --> 00:24:21,680
I still have to look after her.

404
00:24:22,039 --> 00:24:23,839
I'm just learning from you, my brother.

405
00:24:24,160 --> 00:24:25,519
One has to show gratitude, after all.

406
00:24:25,839 --> 00:24:26,839
In any case,

407
00:24:26,839 --> 00:24:29,079
she worked hard for me for decades.

408
00:24:29,079 --> 00:24:30,240
I can't just leave her high and dry.

409
00:24:30,519 --> 00:24:32,440
And you, leader, can't leave me hanging.

410
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:34,480
The land I got when I first came here—

411
00:24:34,480 --> 00:24:36,079
it was just a wasteland back then.

412
00:24:36,200 --> 00:24:38,720
Then it became an industrial park,

413
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:40,400
and then they had me do real estate.

414
00:24:40,400 --> 00:24:43,119
After that, they claimed the land back.

415
00:24:43,119 --> 00:24:45,000
Now the equipment in that factory—

416
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:46,559
we haven't even agreed on compensation,

417
00:24:46,559 --> 00:24:48,000
and they want me to relocate again.

418
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:49,039
How am I supposed to move?

419
00:24:49,079 --> 00:24:50,319
I'll leave it in your hands, brother.

420
00:24:52,839 --> 00:24:53,880
I'm heading to the restroom.

421
00:24:57,119 --> 00:24:57,799
I'll come along too.

422
00:25:00,319 --> 00:25:01,039
Sit down, sit down.

423
00:25:01,240 --> 00:25:01,559
Alright.

424
00:25:02,559 --> 00:25:03,279
Come on, brother.

425
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:04,920
I'll go with you.

426
00:25:05,279 --> 00:25:05,839
Okay.

427
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:10,680
Don't worry about the compensation yet.

428
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:12,279
I'll draft a plan later.

429
00:25:12,279 --> 00:25:13,279
Once the higher-ups approve it,

430
00:25:13,279 --> 00:25:14,799
everything will be easy, alright?

431
00:25:15,160 --> 00:25:17,319
That's not what I'm worried about.

432
00:25:17,960 --> 00:25:19,880
What's urgent is the district office.

433
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:21,759
Their current place is way too small,

434
00:25:21,759 --> 00:25:23,519
so they need to relocate.

435
00:25:24,079 --> 00:25:25,640
But this Minister Guo...

436
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:27,039
He won't budge at all.

437
00:25:27,839 --> 00:25:29,759
Could you arrange a dinner with him?

438
00:25:29,759 --> 00:25:31,839
Stop chasing after mere crumbs,

439
00:25:31,839 --> 00:25:32,359
will you?

440
00:25:32,720 --> 00:25:34,000
I gave you the People's Park project,

441
00:25:34,319 --> 00:25:35,759
such a massive piece of the pie!

442
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:36,759
I'm telling you,

443
00:25:36,759 --> 00:25:38,160
even when the vice mayor called me,

444
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:39,759
I turned him down flat.

445
00:25:39,759 --> 00:25:40,880
And you still want more?

446
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:44,039
Every little bit counts!

447
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:47,119
Small projects bring quick returns.

448
00:25:49,200 --> 00:25:51,359
A case happened in the next county.

449
00:25:51,359 --> 00:25:52,799
A leak in the Armed Forces Department.

450
00:25:52,799 --> 00:25:54,279
A bug was planted in the wall.

451
00:25:54,279 --> 00:25:55,359
Have you heard about it?

452
00:25:55,839 --> 00:25:57,759
Really? Which county?

453
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:01,279
When something like that happens,

454
00:26:01,279 --> 00:26:03,359
that county will have hell to pay.

455
00:26:03,359 --> 00:26:04,519
Let me tell you,

456
00:26:04,519 --> 00:26:06,119
there are things you must never touch.

457
00:26:06,319 --> 00:26:07,920
Taint yourself with trouble,

458
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:08,920
and you won't get a seat at the table.

459
00:26:09,960 --> 00:26:11,559
There are meals you can take,

460
00:26:11,559 --> 00:26:13,319
and meals you must never touch.

461
00:26:13,799 --> 00:26:16,279
Food poisoning can get you killed.

462
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:18,799
You've been in the mainland for so long,

463
00:26:18,799 --> 00:26:20,519
surely you understand this principle.

464
00:26:20,519 --> 00:26:22,200
I'll definitely listen to you.

465
00:26:23,680 --> 00:26:25,039
The problem is,

466
00:26:25,039 --> 00:26:26,880
I've already paved the way and paid up.

467
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:29,240
At the new place they're moving to,

468
00:26:29,240 --> 00:26:32,200
I hired the third-party crew.

469
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:32,880
The crew can pull out,

470
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:34,319
but the money's already gone!

471
00:26:35,720 --> 00:26:37,200
How come I've never heard you

472
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:38,599
mention this before?

473
00:26:38,599 --> 00:26:40,480
If I came to you with every little detail,

474
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:41,799
wouldn't you get sick to death of me?

475
00:26:48,119 --> 00:26:48,680
Time to go.

476
00:26:51,079 --> 00:26:52,359
Brother-in-law, how are you getting home?

477
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:53,720
Don't worry about me.

478
00:26:53,960 --> 00:26:55,359
Take my buddy home first.

479
00:26:57,039 --> 00:26:59,119
We've had our drink, now head home.

480
00:26:59,359 --> 00:27:00,559
No one needs to see anyone off.

481
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:04,119
About the Cross-Strait Fair investment,

482
00:27:04,119 --> 00:27:05,759
you've got to help me keep an eye on it.

483
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:08,160
The Trade Fair is a huge deal.

484
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,960
I've been under a lot of pressure lately.

485
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:11,880
Find more investors from Taiwan, China.

486
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:14,440
Don't you worry about a thing, brother.

487
00:27:14,720 --> 00:27:16,279
As for those companies from this morning,

488
00:27:16,279 --> 00:27:17,279
if any of them dare not show up,

489
00:27:17,279 --> 00:27:18,680
I'll shoot them myself!

490
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:22,119
Leaders, I'll go get the car.

491
00:27:22,119 --> 00:27:22,920
See you, see you.

492
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:23,720
All right, all right.

493
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:24,599
Take care, see you.

494
00:27:24,599 --> 00:27:24,920
I'm off, Brother-in-law.

495
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:25,519
Take care.

496
00:27:25,519 --> 00:27:26,599
Take care, take care!

497
00:27:42,039 --> 00:27:43,759
Some people get promoted,

498
00:27:43,759 --> 00:27:45,359
and forget all about their brothers.

499
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:47,680
Now that you're a county magistrate,

500
00:27:47,680 --> 00:27:49,880
you just run to the municipal committee.

501
00:27:50,279 --> 00:27:51,599
Passing through Gulou District,

502
00:27:51,599 --> 00:27:53,440
couldn't you at least give me a call?

503
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:55,400
Afraid I can't afford to buy you a meal?

504
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:00,480
Are you still running around

505
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:03,200
for your Armed Forces Department leak?

506
00:28:04,799 --> 00:28:06,319
The court sentenced them that fast?

507
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:07,440
How many years?

508
00:28:08,359 --> 00:28:09,680
The death penalty.

509
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:13,119
What did they lose

510
00:28:13,119 --> 00:28:14,240
to warrant execution?

511
00:28:16,519 --> 00:28:17,160
All right, all right.

512
00:28:17,279 --> 00:28:18,000
Okay, okay.

513
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:18,680
Go ahead with your work.

514
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:19,640
I'll let you go.

515
00:28:28,279 --> 00:28:28,799
Heading out now.

516
00:28:37,599 --> 00:28:38,400
Who is it?

517
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:41,480
Someone I know.

518
00:28:42,240 --> 00:28:43,039
Where is it?

519
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:51,799
Over there.

520
00:29:34,359 --> 00:29:36,519
I thought you went to Zhangzhou with them.

521
00:29:37,279 --> 00:29:38,759
Who did you get this drunk with?

522
00:29:38,960 --> 00:29:40,480
Next time you look for a boyfriend,

523
00:29:40,799 --> 00:29:42,400
let me vet him for you.

524
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:45,079
Getting you drunk and taking off first...

525
00:29:45,079 --> 00:29:46,799
What kind of scumbag does that?

526
00:29:46,799 --> 00:29:48,240
He's even worse than me!

527
00:29:50,680 --> 00:29:52,759
Skip the Chamber dinner tonight.

528
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:54,359
They'll drink you to death.

529
00:30:07,039 --> 00:30:07,839
Who was that?

530
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:09,359
Was it that scumbag?

531
00:30:09,359 --> 00:30:10,599
Did his conscience finally kick in?

532
00:30:10,839 --> 00:30:12,319
My family's pushing blind dates on me.

533
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:13,640
It's so annoying.

534
00:30:14,720 --> 00:30:16,160
In such a rush to get married?

535
00:30:17,240 --> 00:30:18,599
I don't really care.

536
00:30:18,799 --> 00:30:19,960
If I feel like getting married, I will.

537
00:30:21,799 --> 00:30:23,240
What about your last boyfriend?

538
00:30:23,799 --> 00:30:25,319
Are you still with him?

539
00:30:25,319 --> 00:30:26,640
Why are you still going on blind dates?

540
00:30:26,640 --> 00:30:28,359
What else am I supposed to do?

541
00:30:29,480 --> 00:30:30,920
It's not like you'd marry me.

542
00:30:36,559 --> 00:30:37,880
Would you still marry me?

543
00:30:52,680 --> 00:30:54,400
For the two of us,

544
00:30:54,920 --> 00:30:57,079
not marrying is what's best for you.

545
00:31:00,279 --> 00:31:01,200
Why?

546
00:31:04,119 --> 00:31:05,640
Someone like me,

547
00:31:06,599 --> 00:31:08,359
what kind of life I'd lead,

548
00:31:09,519 --> 00:31:11,000
even I don't know.

549
00:31:22,279 --> 00:31:24,359
Sure, whatever works.

550
00:31:25,119 --> 00:31:26,480
As long as you're happy with it.

551
00:31:28,160 --> 00:31:29,680
Any day is fine for the wedding.

552
00:32:02,039 --> 00:32:03,880
Still not asleep? What are you doing?

553
00:32:07,039 --> 00:32:08,000
Gambling.

554
00:32:10,319 --> 00:32:12,160
Lin Kanshan again,

555
00:32:12,160 --> 00:32:13,720
and Ma Qi again.

556
00:32:13,720 --> 00:32:15,000
With so many pieces in play

557
00:32:15,839 --> 00:32:16,799
and the stakes so high,

558
00:32:16,799 --> 00:32:19,079
do you think you can win?

559
00:32:27,759 --> 00:32:29,759
Brother, I want this plot of land.

560
00:32:29,839 --> 00:32:30,839
The policies are great,

561
00:32:30,839 --> 00:32:32,160
and the paperwork is complete.

562
00:32:32,160 --> 00:32:34,119
We just need the district's approval,

563
00:32:34,119 --> 00:32:36,240
and your stamp, brother.

564
00:32:36,559 --> 00:32:38,279
Hold on, I'm busy. We'll talk later.

565
00:32:52,599 --> 00:32:54,039
You ignored all the good locations,

566
00:32:54,319 --> 00:32:55,559
and insisted on the city outskirts,

567
00:32:55,759 --> 00:32:57,400
right next to the dual-use airport.

568
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:59,799
The new place they're relocating to,

569
00:32:59,799 --> 00:33:02,200
I hired the third-party construction team.

570
00:33:02,599 --> 00:33:04,079
How come I've never heard you mention

571
00:33:04,079 --> 00:33:05,000
anything about this?

572
00:33:09,599 --> 00:33:10,359
Xiao Guo,

573
00:33:11,039 --> 00:33:12,680
that spy case in the neighboring county,

574
00:33:13,279 --> 00:33:14,480
how was it cracked?

575
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:15,880
The details

576
00:33:16,279 --> 00:33:17,519
haven't been briefed.

577
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:21,000
I heard a married couple carried it out.

578
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:23,200
They claimed they had no idea

579
00:33:23,200 --> 00:33:24,480
they were being used,

580
00:33:24,480 --> 00:33:27,400
and even called it their side gig.

581
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:29,519
If that's not legal ignorance, what is?

582
00:33:30,799 --> 00:33:32,359
You think it's legal ignorance?

583
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:35,079
I'd say it's just an excuse.

584
00:33:36,039 --> 00:33:38,319
Security education cannot wait.

585
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:49,279
Clear my schedule this afternoon.

586
00:33:49,279 --> 00:33:51,039
Organize a study session for everyone.

587
00:33:51,200 --> 00:33:52,039
Everyone?

588
00:33:52,640 --> 00:33:53,200
Understood.

589
00:33:55,920 --> 00:33:56,680
Brother.

590
00:33:57,599 --> 00:33:58,119
Secretary-General Lin.

591
00:33:58,119 --> 00:33:58,680
Secretary Guo.

592
00:33:59,319 --> 00:34:01,240
Drinking the chief's tea every time, huh?

593
00:34:01,240 --> 00:34:03,039
No matter how close, don't just take.

594
00:34:03,279 --> 00:34:05,279
I brewed the good tea just for the chief.

595
00:34:05,640 --> 00:34:06,799
Will do, Secretary-General Lin.

596
00:34:06,799 --> 00:34:09,159
How can you all just take without giving?

597
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:10,760
Let me announce a rule.

598
00:34:10,760 --> 00:34:13,400
From now on, bring your own tea here.

599
00:34:13,400 --> 00:34:16,280
You can freeload the district's hot water.

600
00:34:19,480 --> 00:34:20,280
Secretary-General Lin,

601
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:20,760
have some water.

602
00:34:23,679 --> 00:34:24,920
Xiao Guo, wait a moment.

603
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:29,880
Need something, Secretary-General Lin?

604
00:34:31,480 --> 00:34:33,320
I wouldn't drop by without a good reason.

605
00:34:33,360 --> 00:34:34,599
Gifting presents, gifting tea...

606
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:37,159
How about reporting on work, brother?

607
00:34:39,320 --> 00:34:40,840
Give the gifts to the District Discipline and Inspection Committee.

608
00:34:41,719 --> 00:34:42,599
Submit them under my name,

609
00:34:42,599 --> 00:34:43,519
and have them registered on record.

610
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:44,880
As for how to handle them,

611
00:34:44,880 --> 00:34:46,719
I will defer to the Discipline and Inspection Committee.

612
00:34:46,719 --> 00:34:47,280
Go ahead.

613
00:34:54,039 --> 00:34:54,639
Go on.

614
00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:03,239
Brother,

615
00:35:04,239 --> 00:35:05,480
if you do this,

616
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:07,360
won't it look like taking bribes?

617
00:35:07,719 --> 00:35:09,400
You bribed me first,

618
00:35:09,760 --> 00:35:11,280
and I am rejecting the bribe.

619
00:35:13,119 --> 00:35:14,599
I advise you to turn yourself in.

620
00:35:15,559 --> 00:35:17,480
It could reduce your sentence.

621
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:25,039
If I'm at the Discipline and Inspection Committee,

622
00:35:25,239 --> 00:35:26,440
I might get a loose tongue

623
00:35:27,039 --> 00:35:28,159
and spill everything.

624
00:35:34,840 --> 00:35:35,840
Spill what?

625
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:42,119
Mining disasters?

626
00:35:42,119 --> 00:35:43,639
Or forced demolitions?

627
00:35:43,840 --> 00:35:44,920
Drinking, gambling, whoring,

628
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:46,280
bribing and corrupting officials—

629
00:35:46,360 --> 00:35:48,000
which of those didn't you do?

630
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:57,440
I'll serve whatever prison time I deserve.

631
00:35:57,960 --> 00:35:59,880
But when young Master Wu was in Xiamen,

632
00:36:00,159 --> 00:36:01,559
during that period,

633
00:36:02,119 --> 00:36:03,679
someone delivered something to him.

634
00:36:03,960 --> 00:36:04,960
A record was kept.

635
00:36:07,079 --> 00:36:08,400
I have the photos.

636
00:36:09,239 --> 00:36:10,800
Whether he accepted it doesn't matter.

637
00:36:11,679 --> 00:36:12,400
What matters is,

638
00:36:12,400 --> 00:36:13,760
once they surface,

639
00:36:15,719 --> 00:36:17,159
how will you explain it?

640
00:36:17,639 --> 00:36:18,400
Lin Kanshan,

641
00:36:18,519 --> 00:36:20,039
believe I can call the police right now

642
00:36:20,039 --> 00:36:21,199
to have you locked up?

643
00:36:21,199 --> 00:36:22,920
Do you think you can leave this building?

644
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:24,480
What difference do photos make?

645
00:36:24,679 --> 00:36:25,679
What of it?

646
00:36:32,119 --> 00:36:32,880
Come in.

647
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:35,760
District Mayor,

648
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:36,800
the meeting starts on the hour.

649
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:38,119
The Secretary is about to arrive.

650
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:40,960
See our guest out.

651
00:36:50,079 --> 00:36:52,159
Brother, I'll take my leave then.

652
00:37:43,199 --> 00:37:45,000
We must note two recent matters.

653
00:37:45,400 --> 00:37:47,639
One is hosting the Fujian-Taiwan, China

654
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:51,559
same-name village gathering.

655
00:37:51,880 --> 00:37:55,199
It supports the 5th Cultural Trade Forum,

656
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:57,400
where 19 pairs of same-name villages

657
00:37:58,039 --> 00:37:59,679
in Fujian and Taiwan, China will pair up.

658
00:37:59,920 --> 00:38:01,360
Word on the street is

659
00:38:01,559 --> 00:38:03,320
that your house lost cash and gold bars,

660
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,239
a huge amount, in fact.

661
00:38:05,039 --> 00:38:07,199
Just rumors. The cyber police handled it.

662
00:38:07,360 --> 00:38:09,119
The mongers will be strictly punished.

663
00:38:09,360 --> 00:38:11,880
I also heard those fake online rumors

664
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:14,320
were all planted by Qian Xinfu.

665
00:38:14,639 --> 00:38:16,039
When he was head of Yongtai County,

666
00:38:16,039 --> 00:38:17,039
you gave him a hard time.

667
00:38:17,039 --> 00:38:17,719
And some say

668
00:38:17,719 --> 00:38:20,400
he's competing with you for vice mayor.

669
00:38:20,960 --> 00:38:21,960
Another matter is

670
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:24,559
bringing 10K students from Taiwan, China

671
00:38:24,559 --> 00:38:28,360
to Fujian for study tours and travel.

672
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:30,280
Specifically, within five years,

673
00:38:30,519 --> 00:38:33,679
we'll invite over 50 universities from Taiwan, China

674
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:35,639
and over 10,000 students from Taiwan, China

675
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,480
to come here for study tours and travel.

676
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:40,920
Coordinate with the Tourism Bureau

677
00:38:41,119 --> 00:38:43,440
and the Provincial Taiwan, China Affairs Office,

678
00:38:43,519 --> 00:38:44,440
ensuring seamless communication.

679
00:38:45,239 --> 00:38:46,960
This matter may not seem big,

680
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:48,800
but its impact is significant.

681
00:38:49,559 --> 00:38:52,280
We cannot afford any blunders or slip-ups.

682
00:39:09,320 --> 00:39:10,880
Trust me, that's definitely how it is.

683
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:14,360
District Mayor.

684
00:39:18,199 --> 00:39:19,039
Is the private room booked?

685
00:39:19,199 --> 00:39:20,599
Everything's arranged, don't worry.

686
00:39:34,039 --> 00:39:34,840
Brother,

687
00:39:38,159 --> 00:39:39,960
Old Xiao told me you asked him out tonight

688
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:41,800
to hit the sauna at Wen Zongshu's place.

689
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:42,920
Why didn't you invite me?

690
00:39:43,199 --> 00:39:44,400
So stingy of you.

691
00:39:44,400 --> 00:39:46,039
Would one more ticket break the bank?

692
00:39:46,079 --> 00:39:47,000
Come on, brother.

693
00:39:47,400 --> 00:39:49,239
You had that big leadership meeting.

694
00:39:49,440 --> 00:39:50,480
I'd dare invite you,

695
00:39:50,559 --> 00:39:52,000
but I wouldn't dare invite your bosses.

696
00:39:52,159 --> 00:39:53,840
Reporting work in the buff?

697
00:39:54,039 --> 00:39:55,480
I have no experience with that.

698
00:39:57,079 --> 00:39:58,960
Even your stinginess sounds noble.

699
00:40:00,199 --> 00:40:01,440
You're treating today as punishment.

700
00:40:01,679 --> 00:40:03,000
Don't tell me...

701
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:05,280
that fake booze from last time is gone?

702
00:40:06,679 --> 00:40:09,239
They're cracking down hard on DUIs lately.

703
00:40:09,480 --> 00:40:11,119
It doesn't matter to me; I'm not worried.

704
00:40:11,320 --> 00:40:13,760
You and Director Xiao are in the system,

705
00:40:13,760 --> 00:40:15,119
so I wouldn't dare take that risk.

706
00:40:16,159 --> 00:40:17,960
What happened with Qian Xinfu?

707
00:40:18,400 --> 00:40:19,480
Was he drunk?

708
00:40:23,159 --> 00:40:26,119
Heard someone reported him.

709
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:28,199
A rookie cop on duty

710
00:40:28,679 --> 00:40:30,719
walked in, cuffed him, and hauled him off.

711
00:40:30,960 --> 00:40:32,360
The kid didn't know who he was, after all.

712
00:40:32,679 --> 00:40:34,960
He got drunk and couldn't control himself.

713
00:40:35,199 --> 00:40:36,559
He has no one else to blame.

714
00:40:38,519 --> 00:40:40,239
From now on, drinking only on weekends.

715
00:40:40,440 --> 00:40:43,079
No driving allowed. Private dinners only.

716
00:40:43,599 --> 00:40:44,880
Set something up later.

717
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:45,960
Invite the urban construction bureau,

718
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:47,360
and friends from the Armed Forces Dept.

719
00:40:47,360 --> 00:40:48,280
Bring them all.

720
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:50,320
We'll go to Kangle Street for bone soup.

721
00:40:50,440 --> 00:40:51,800
Sounds good. A health-conscious dinner.

722
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:55,480
Go order the food.

723
00:40:55,719 --> 00:40:56,440
Sure, right away.

724
00:40:58,800 --> 00:41:00,639
Don't save Boss Lin any money!

725
00:41:01,440 --> 00:41:02,639
Generous of you, Mr. Lin.

726
00:41:02,639 --> 00:41:03,800
Don't mention it.

727
00:41:03,880 --> 00:41:06,039
Order two mud eels to build your strength.

728
00:41:06,440 --> 00:41:07,199
Got it, got it.

729
00:41:10,840 --> 00:41:12,000
Be straight with me.

730
00:41:12,559 --> 00:41:13,719
What are you really up to?

731
00:41:14,519 --> 00:41:15,320
Brother,

732
00:41:17,000 --> 00:41:19,880
I came from Taipei to the mainland.

733
00:41:20,519 --> 00:41:23,159
What else would I do besides make money?

734
00:41:50,360 --> 00:41:52,760
Wu Jinhe is going after Lin Kanshan.

735
00:42:06,760 --> 00:42:07,480
Brother-in-law.

736
00:42:09,440 --> 00:42:10,679
Where did you come from?

737
00:42:10,840 --> 00:42:12,079
I didn't even see you.

738
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:14,199
Didn't your phone die?

739
00:42:14,199 --> 00:42:15,440
Where did you call me from?

740
00:42:15,960 --> 00:42:17,119
I used a payphone.

741
00:42:17,760 --> 00:42:19,679
I suspect someone is monitoring my phone.

742
00:42:19,679 --> 00:42:21,400
Nine times out of ten, it's Lin Kanshan.

743
00:42:21,679 --> 00:42:23,440
Weren't you on good terms with him?

744
00:42:23,440 --> 00:42:24,519
What happened?

745
00:42:25,519 --> 00:42:27,760
It's always close friends who fall out.

746
00:42:28,360 --> 00:42:29,480
I won't get into details.

747
00:42:29,920 --> 00:42:31,719
Don't you have a friend working in State Security?

748
00:42:32,159 --> 00:42:34,119
Can you look into his background for me?

749
00:42:34,719 --> 00:42:36,239
And check my phone, too,

750
00:42:36,239 --> 00:42:38,079
along with my office landline,

751
00:42:38,159 --> 00:42:40,119
to see if they're bugged or something.

752
00:42:40,119 --> 00:42:41,440
Did you find something out?

753
00:42:41,920 --> 00:42:43,079
Not really.

754
00:42:43,880 --> 00:42:45,679
You know these people from Taiwan, China.

755
00:42:45,679 --> 00:42:47,119
He never tells the truth.

756
00:42:47,119 --> 00:42:48,679
To do business and make money,

757
00:42:48,679 --> 00:42:50,039
they'd do anything.

758
00:42:50,280 --> 00:42:52,559
It never hurts to be careful.

759
00:42:54,840 --> 00:42:56,199
Tell your brother-in-law the truth.

760
00:43:00,199 --> 00:43:01,559
Are you with State Security?

761
00:43:08,360 --> 00:43:09,159
I'm Oho Ou,

762
00:43:09,159 --> 00:43:10,760
inviting you to watch the drama

763
00:43:10,760 --> 00:43:11,800
"Confrontation."

764
00:43:11,800 --> 00:43:13,559
If I were you, I wouldn't leave.

765
00:43:13,559 --> 00:43:16,079
Without evidence, no one can arrest you.

766
00:43:18,039 --> 00:43:19,599
For nearly 20 years,

767
00:43:19,599 --> 00:43:22,199
this mole has been right beside us.

768
00:43:22,199 --> 00:43:23,159
As long as this list

769
00:43:23,159 --> 00:43:25,639
with real names is leaked,

770
00:43:25,639 --> 00:43:28,159
my suspect will be confirmed as the mole.

771
00:43:29,159 --> 00:43:30,440
You mean...

772
00:43:30,440 --> 00:43:31,480
What I mean is,

773
00:43:31,480 --> 00:43:34,079
don't leave Taipei for the time being.

774
00:43:34,320 --> 00:43:35,719
Wait for further orders.
